<title>USA: Texas Star grants options to employees.</title>
<headline>Texas Star grants options to employees.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Star Resources Corp said on Friday that it granted its employees incentive options for the purchase of a total of 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>The options can be exercised on or before September 11, 2001, at a price of $0.53 per share, the company said. The stock was trading recently at $0.56 a share.</p>
<p>The options are subject to regulatory approval.</p>
